---
const contactUrl = 'https://xn--3-sj5c.jp/#contact';
---

<section id="scout-cta" class="scout-cta" aria-label="デモ・音源募集">
  <p class="scout-cta__label">SCOUT WINDOW</p>
  <h2 class="scout-cta__title">音楽をやっているあなたへ。</h2>
  <p class="scout-cta__body">
    Mash Room Studioは札幌から新しい才能を探しています。デモ・音源、聴かせてください。
  </p>
  <a class="scout-cta__link" href={contactUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
    デモ・音源を送る
  </a>
</section>

<style>
  .scout-cta {
    margin: 4rem auto;
    padding: 2rem;
    max-width: 760px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(74, 72, 69, 0.22);
    border-left: 6px solid #4a7c6f;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
    color: #2a2826;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(42, 40, 38, 0.08);
  }

  .scout-cta__label {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    font-family: 'Inter', 'Noto Sans JP', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: #4a7c6f;
  }

  .scout-cta__title {
    margin: 0 0 0.8rem;
    font-family: 'Shippori Mincho', 'Noto Serif JP', serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.4rem);
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .scout-cta__body {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .scout-cta__link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.35rem;
    border: 1px solid #2a2826;
    background: #2a2826;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;
  }

  .scout-cta__link:hover {
    background: #4a7c6f;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .scout-cta {
      margin: 3rem 1rem;
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
